{"id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-effective-procedure.md","title":"Effective Procedure","display":"df-effective-procedure — Effective Procedure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-effective-procedure","aliases":["90-df-effective-procedure"],"display":"df-effective-procedure — Effective Procedure","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-tm-output]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-effective-procedure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-effective-procedure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-procedure — Effective Procedure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定集合的表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\iota_X)\">\\((X,\\iota_X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\iota_Y)\">\\((Y,\\iota_Y)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是给定单射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq X\\times Y\">\\(P\\subseteq X\\times Y\\)</span> 为单值关系。表示是环境数据，不在定义时任意重新选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM},\\Sigma_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{TM},\\Sigma_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>无下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Effective}\">\\(\\operatorname{Effective}\\)</span> 与带下标形式使用这里固定的同一对表示；数值有限列采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 为输出字串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\bigl[\n&amp;\\iota_X[X]\\subseteq\\Sigma_M^*\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\ (\\operatorname{Halts}_M(\\iota_X(x))\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(x,y)\\in P\\ \\operatorname{Output}_M(\\iota_X(x))=\\iota_Y(y)\\bigr],\\\\\nM(w)\\downarrow=z&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\land\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\land\\operatorname{Output}_M(w)=z,\\\\\nM(w)\\uparrow&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\bigl[\n&amp;\\iota_X[X]\\subseteq\\Sigma_M^*\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\ (\\operatorname{Halts}_M(\\iota_X(x))\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(x,y)\\in P\\ \\operatorname{Output}_M(\\iota_X(x))=\\iota_Y(y)\\bigr],\\\\\nM(w)\\downarrow=z&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\land\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\land\\operatorname{Output}_M(w)=z,\\\\\nM(w)\\uparrow&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Effective}(P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Effective}(P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留相对于固定输入／输出表示的有效性谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_X,\\iota_Y\">\\(\\iota_X,\\iota_Y\\)</span> 是表示映射的名字，不是唯一描述算子。省略下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Effective}\">\\(\\operatorname{Effective}\\)</span> 只在两种表示已经固定时使用。数值元组取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span>；有效签名的语法对象取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的有限树表示。对一般抽象集合，“解码”指表示的逆；若声称在另一表示中可计算，必须给出两种表示间的可计算转换。定义不声称 Church–Turing 论题是已经证明的等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-output","status":"resolved","id":"fff1247dc8d93b4d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-output]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM},\\Sigma_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M$ 分别见 [[88-df-turing-machine]]、[[