ota_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq X\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM},\\Sigma_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Effective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wordenc}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma_M^*","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\bigl[\n&\\iota_X[X]\\subseteq\\Sigma_M^*\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in X\\ (\\operatorname{Halts}_M(\\iota_X(x))\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall(x,y)\\in P\\ \\operatorname{Output}_M(\\iota_X(x))=\\iota_Y(y)\\bigr],\\\\\nM(w)\\downarrow=z&\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\land\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\land\\operatorname{Output}_M(w)=z,\\\\\nM(w)\\uparrow&\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Effective}(P)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}(P).","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota_X,\\iota_Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Effective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wordenc}","display":false}],"bytes":2327,"backlinks":[{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为部分函数。输入和输出固定为 [[88-df-encoding]] 的 $\\operatorname{wordenc}$ 数值元组表示。$\\mathrm{Effective}(f)$ 取 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 的形式化、相对表示的谓词，不指尚未形式化的经验概念；$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。本文件的 $\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}$ 是下式给出的同表示机器可计算性接口。"},{"id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$E$ 的表示在 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 意义下固定；$\\mathbb N$ 的固定词表示取 [[88-df-encoding]] 的 $n\\mapsto\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle n\\rangle)$；与通常二进制展开的转换双向可计算。若 $E=\\operatorname{Expr}(S)$，则要求给定 $\\operatorname{EffSig}(S,\\eta)$，采用 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的语法树表示及 [[90-df-formula]] 的带类型载体。"},{"id":"7d83e22f672cfb25","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U,V:\\mathcal B^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal B^*$；$\\mathrm{Effective}$ 取 [[90-df-effective-procedure]]，输入输出词均以恒等表示呈示，机器取 [[88-df-turing-machine]]。"},{"id":"5cc312c6e3fc50d2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Effective}$ 取 [[90-df-effective-procedure]]，字串采用恒等表示，自然数采用该文件固定的数值词表示。"},{"id":"295ebb9be4755370","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Effective}$ (effective-procedure predicate, see [[90-df-effective-procedure]])"},{"id":"8959cc2a17246321","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$d:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$ 为双射，$\\mathrm{Effective}(d)$ 相对于 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 的自然数二进制表示和字串恒等表示；$\\widehat K_U$ 是下式定义的数值函数。$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]、[[90-df-effective-procedure]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonaliz